        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx 2-methyl-1-butanol, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx 2-methyl-1-butanol, at plant
The multioutput-process "amyl alcohol production process" delivers the co-products 1-pentanol, 2-methyl-1-butanol, and 3-methyl-1-butanl. The allocation is based on mass balance.;
UUID: 1780694e-0f44-3eee-8ffd-d2c2ce11b4f2
Hydroformylation of butene including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Hydroformylation of butene
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports and emissions are modelled with standard methods.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1780694e-0f44-3eee-8ffd-d2c2ce11b4f2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
